      "source": [
        "In this notebook, we’ll train a CNN to recognize different **car parts** from images. These might include parts like:\n",
        "- air compressor\n",
        "- battery\n",
        "- brake caliper\n",
        "- coil spring\n",
        "- oil pan and so on\n",
        "\n",
        "**Total of 50 car parts**\n"
