      "source": [
        "## Training Analysis and Conclusion\n",
        "\n",
        "The baseline CNN shows clear signs of overfitting. The lowest validation loss,\n",
        "**2.0071**, was reached at epoch 3. After this point, the training loss continued\n",
        "to decrease, while the validation loss increased substantially.\n",
        "\n",
        "At epoch 15, the model achieved a training accuracy of **98.50%** and a training\n",
        "loss of **0.0482**. In comparison, the validation accuracy was **54.80%** and the\n",
        "validation loss increased to **4.9516**.\n",
        "\n",
        "Although the highest validation accuracy was reached at epoch 15, the increasing\n",
        "validation loss indicates that the model became increasingly confident without\n",
        "achieving a proportional improvement on unseen data. Based on validation loss,\n",
        "epoch 3 represents the strongest generalization point.\n",
        "\n",
        "These results indicate severe overfitting. Data augmentation, Dropout, early\n",
        "stopping, Batch Normalization, L2 regularization, or a less parameter-heavy\n",
        "architecture could help improve generalization."
      ]
    },
